  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of students in the class is **28**, but no information is given about the price of a pack of glue sticks.\n\nTherefore, the retail price **cannot be determined from the information provided**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 27 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Knowing that the class has **27 students** still does not provide the price of a pack of glue sticks.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: the glue sticks come in packs of 9.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The class needs\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 9 = 3\n\\]\n\npacks of glue sticks. However, no total cost or price information is provided, so the retail price of one pack cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. The glue sticks come in packs of 8.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Each student needs one glue stick. Since packs contain 8 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 8 = 3\\text{ remainder }3\n\\]\n\nSo the class would need **4 packs**, but the price of one pack is not given.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: the school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for $6.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The store sells each pack of glue sticks for **$6**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: the store does not offer discounts on glue-stick packs.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The retail price is already given as **$6 per pack**. Since the store does not offer discounts, the price remains unchanged.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How many packs of glue sticks does Mr. Jackson need to buy so every student can have 2 glue sticks? By the way, here are some relevant details: Mr. Jackson wants to give each student 2 glue sticks. Mr. Jackson can only buy whole packs and expects to have some extra glue sticks left over.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Mr. Jackson needs:\n\n\\[\n27 \\times 2 = 54\n\\]\n\nglue sticks in total.\n\nEach pack contains 8 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n54 \\div 8 = 6\\text{ remainder }6\n\\]\n\nSince he must buy whole packs, he needs to buy **7 packs**. That provides:\n\n\\[\n7 \\times 8 = 56\n\\]\n\nglue sticks, leaving **2 extra**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7\\text{ packs}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
